  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "升任首席内容官  (Chun Yuqiao's Surprise Return as Chief Content Officer)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "lin_jie": "林姐",
    "crew": "场务"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Discharged from hospital and newly appointed Chief Content Officer, Chun Yuqiao walks into Studio Four to a congratulatory cake—and immediately holds Unit Two accountable for the allergy mishap. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "你怎么出院了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这是我们星天新任的首席内容官，淳于总制片人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "蛋糕来喽！老大，恭喜您升任首席内容官！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这是我们大伙一点心意，早就为您准备好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "翻译过敏是怎么回事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "那是个意外，他们没有调查好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你是现场组吗？谁让你说话？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "老大，是我的责任，我只核对了米娜一个人的饮食习惯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你在一部操作过多少国际团队？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "老大，我们保证不会再有下次了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这种东西我不需要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这是大家的一片心意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "用不着，你们的心意我消化不了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "你怎么出院了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How come you are already out of the hospital?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这是我们星天新任的首席内容官，淳于总制片人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is Xingtian's newly appointed Chief Content Officer, Chief Producer Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "蛋糕来喽！老大，恭喜您升任首席内容官！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here comes the cake! Boss, congratulations on your promotion to Chief Content Officer!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这是我们大伙一点心意，早就为您准备好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is a small token from all of us, prepared for you ahead of time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "翻译过敏是怎么回事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened with the interpreter's allergic reaction?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "那是个意外，他们没有调查好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It was an accident—they did not check thoroughly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你是现场组吗？谁让你说话？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you on the floor crew? Who asked you to speak up?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "老大，是我的责任，我只核对了米娜一个人的饮食习惯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, it is my responsibility—I only verified Mina's own dietary needs.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你在一部操作过多少国际团队？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How many international guest teams did you handle back in Unit One?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "老大，我们保证不会再有下次了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, we promise it will never happen again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这种东西我不需要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have no need for things like this cake.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这是大家的一片心意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is a gesture of goodwill from everyone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "用不着，你们的心意我消化不了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Save it—after today's sloppiness, I cannot stomach your goodwill.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "你怎么出院了？",
      "gap": 0.5
